hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"417","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: buri misaal hamare liye nahin hai; jo apna tohfa wapas leta hai, woh us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qai (ulti) ki taraf lautta hai."
"418","Ahmad binul Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hatim bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abul Asbat al-Harisi — jin ka naam Bishr bin Rafi' hai — ne Yahya bin Abi Kasir se, unhon ne Abu Salama se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kaha: Momin seedha-saada aur shareef hota hai; aur faajir chalaak aur kamina hota hai."
"419","Muhammad bin Umayya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Musa ne Abdullah bin Kaisan se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane mein do aadmi ek doosre ko gaali dene lage; ek gaali de raha tha aur doosra khamosh tha, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam baithe the. Phir doosre ne jawab diya. To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam uth gaye. Kaha gaya: aap uth gaye? Unhon ne kaha: farishte uth gaye, to main bhi un ke saath uth gaya. Yeh jab tak khamosh tha, farishte is ki taraf se gaali dene wale ko jawab de rahe the; jab is ne jawab diya, farishte uth gaye."
"420","Hisham bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rudaih bin Atiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Abi Abla ne hum se bayan kiya, Ummud Darda se: ek aadmi un ke paas aaya aur kaha: ek aadmi ne Abdul Malik ke paas aap ki burai ki hai. Unhon ne kaha: agar hum par woh ilzam lagaya jata hai jo hum mein nahin hai, to kitni hi baar hamari woh taareef ki gayi hai jo hum mein nahin hai."
